66/) [Branch, The (Boquet trib.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1441/) [Branch, The (Schroon trib.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1442/) [Cedar (1.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1280/)\n\n[Cedar (2.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1281/) [Cold](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1287/) [Deer Creek (Hudson Trib.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1184/)[Glen Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1309/)\n\n[Hague Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/10876/) [Hudson (0.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/10653/) [Hudson (1. Indian River to North River)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1321/) [Hudson (2. North River to Riparius)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1322/)\n\n[Hudson (3. Riparius to the Glen)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1323/) [Indian (Hudson trib.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1325/) [John's Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/2913/)[La Chute](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1335/)\n\n[Mettawee](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1343/)[Mill Creek (Essex County](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4251/))                    [Mill Creek (Hudson trib.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1346/) [North Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4303/)\n\n[Pike Brook](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/10886/) [Poultney](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1383/)[Putnam Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/4253/) [Raquette (1.)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River